ADDTEAM TeamA
ADDTEAM TeamB
START DURATION 100 PROBLEM 3
SUBMIT A BY TeamA WITH Wrong_Answer AT 5
SUBMIT A BY TeamA WITH Accepted AT 10
SUBMIT B BY TeamA WITH Accepted AT 30
SUBMIT A BY TeamB WITH Wrong_Answer AT 5
SUBMIT A BY TeamB WITH Accepted AT 10
SUBMIT B BY TeamB WITH Accepted AT 20
FLUSH
FREEZE
SCROLL
END